WEBVTT

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.370
Gourmet Hunters are explorers 
who travel the world,

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.940
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.070
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.190
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.880
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.190
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.640
Go! Shock!!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:58.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.100
Friends who share the same future

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.760
With you guys

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:06.900
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.340
If we join forces

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:12.340
We’ll be invincible

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.940
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:23.520
Delicious food gives life

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:29.020
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:31.100
Let’s eat!!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.100
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.340
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:45.340
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:49.340
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.160
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.160
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.780
The desperate struggle between IGO and 
Gourmet Corp. continued to unfold.

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:17.620
On top of that, a third organization 
apart from Gourmet Corp.,

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:19.380
NEO, started to make its move.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.620
Surprisingly, Shigematsu, the 
vice-president of IGO, is a member.

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:29.310
And Komatsu finally made it back to Toriko,

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.430
only to witness a startling sight.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.490
Toriko Strikes Back! Ultimate Routine!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.820
I was just...

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.440
...finishing up here.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.230
Fork!

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.630
Knife!

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:44.810
Thank you for the meal.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.900
This is that Gourmet Hunter...

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.620
...Toriko!

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.560
It's over.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:11.820
Hey, Komatsu...

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:12.560
Yes?

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:13.870
Komatsu...

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:20.670
You... ever thought of teaming up with me?

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:26.660
Yes!

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.180
I hope I can be of service!

00:04:33.320 --> 00:04:34.950
Knife!

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:38.520
Komatsu!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:45.900
Stop it!!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.480
Sorry I'm late, Komatsu.

00:04:57.740 --> 00:05:00.390
Okay, eat up!

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.660
You have to gather your strength 
for the fest next week.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.220
Thanks to Food's End,

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:10.200
this entire feast will get 
stored up in my body as energy!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.400
Plus, there's what Aimaru 
taught me the other day.

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.000
Now I'm totally ready to 
go toe-to-toe with <i>him</i>!

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:22.730
There's just one thing I don't 
got enough of with this feast.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.710
An important seasoning I need to beat him.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.410
A seasoning?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:32.080
Yeah. Komatsu...

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:35.810
That's having you to protect.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:58.990
Now...

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.740
Come with me, boy.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:19.880
This is the first time you've 
prepared with so much food.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:24.220
I performed Food's End.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.460
So I wouldn't lose against him...

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:30.830
The food my partner made 
is delicious, isn't it?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.470
It certainly does taste good.

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:35.730
But...

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:39.650
...if you want to have 
complete control over me,

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.380
this isn't nearly enough.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:49.280
Prepare that man's Full Course.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.830
That man's...

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.190
...Full Course?

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:59.570
I'm sure you know why everyone 
is searching for it.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:06.630
Although that just depends on opportunity.

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:08.670
Eventually is fine.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.440
If we have an understanding, 
get your ass back there.

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:16.010
The guy you're supposed 
to protect is calling you.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:20.180
Toriko-san!

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:24.280
Toriko-san!!

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.070
Toriko-san!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.100
Toriko-san!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.490
Toriko-san!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.320
Toriko-san!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:46.510
Toriko-san!!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.590
Your voice that calls me

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.460
always gives me power.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.860
Again and again...

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.820
I would get up again and again...

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:11.470
...to protect you!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.790
Thank you, Komatsu.

00:08:16.280 --> 00:08:18.140
Everything's alright now!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.280
T-T-Tori...

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:33.160
Getting up again and again

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.060
is what you do.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.700
I've made allowances for that.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.380
Are you tellin' me you've been holding back?

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.680
Or in other words...

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.710
...were you scared to show me your very best?

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:52.180
'Cause showin' me that means it's your limit.

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:56.040
I don't know my own limits.

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.990
What was that sound?

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.140
From the start,

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.680
I've been goin' at full power,

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.300
Starjun!

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:21.130
The Full Course of techniques

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:23.570
that I laid out for you

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:28.530
were all serious attacks.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:32.380
And I accepted them all with open arms.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:36.340
That's when I learned <i>your</i> limit.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:38.800
I don't know about that.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.060
Then why didn't you take 
that attack just now?

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:47.070
That sound again...

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.720
I don't know...

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:55.740
...what my limits are either!

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.130
What is this?

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:03.510
The force of his techniques...

00:10:04.190 --> 00:10:05.420
...is increasing!

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:15.570
Let's give 'em some space, Yun!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.420
Toriko...

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:28.470
That's what I like about you.

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.440
Even when you're at the end of your rope,

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:35.610
you don't have the slightest 
intention of losing.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.610
In fact, your fighting spirit never flags.

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:43.350
I want to see your limit.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.830
That's the first time...

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.520
...you guarded yourself.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:50.090
Limit...

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:53.330
To me that word don't even apply!

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:56.310
Long as I keep walkin'...

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.770
...I'm gonna advance!

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:00.490
Starjun!

00:11:00.490 --> 00:11:02.910
I’m pretty sure you already noticed.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:07.440
I ain't the same guy I was 
just a little while ago!

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:09.300
This is...

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:13.410
...the routine that Aimaru taught me...

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:17.420
...Ultimate Routine!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.350
Shigematsu-san... Why?

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.550
Sorry, Mansom.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:55.200
That day was the first time...

00:11:56.570 --> 00:12:00.180
...I ever lost a fight.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:02.960
Well?

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.340
How about comin' with me...

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.580
...bandit?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:10.320
This is the first time you ever lost a fight.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:13.150
Make it be the last.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.650
Oh? You can still stand up?

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:21.720
I ain't losin' to anybody

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.740
but the president!

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:26.520
By the way, you got any booze,

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.560
Shigematsu?

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.260
What is it, Ai?

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.810
What do you wanna tell me so badly?

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.900
If you've experienced Food's End,

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.610
you may be able to use this, Toriko.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:54.250
Ultimate Routine...

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:06.480
You certainly...

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.400
...fled far enough.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.440
What was that?

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.650
Your secret technique

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.320
releases pathogenic bacteria from your body.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.630
But this was light years ahead of that.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.140
It's terrifying.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:28.650
Not only that...

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.330
Right before you performed the technique,

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.460
I got an image in my head.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.100
If you hadn't dodged it...

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.260
...that's what would've happened to you.

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.140
What the hell is it?!

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:45.390
What is that "ultimate routine"?!

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:46.400
Explain it!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.530
Hold your horses for a minute.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.740
Let me take a little break.

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:57.170
A "routine" is a series of set movements

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.530
that you always do.

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:01.180
I <i>know</i>!

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.410
While doing the movements, 
you banish idle thoughts

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:05.660
and visualize the technique succeeding.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.700
I already do all that.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:11.600
What's different from what you did?

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.050
To put it simply,

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:17.260
to increase the rate of 
success of a technique,

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:18.810
you do a normal routine.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:23.780
But to draw out the potential of a technique,

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.340
you do an ultimate routine.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:27.630
Wha...?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.930
But it don't make sense.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:33.280
You didn't even do a routine.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.830
The ultimate routine isn't 
a series of movements.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.760
It's <i>imagination</i>.

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.360
What's that supposed to mean?

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:43.070
Toriko...

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.070
The vision I sent you

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:49.370
was proof that my imagination is strong.

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:54.310
The proof is in the pudding,

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:59.940
but can you really raise your 
potential just by imaginin' it?

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.210
With concentration that can't 
be shaken no matter what happens

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.600
and unfailing confidence, you can do it.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:11.220
Is it like autosuggestion?

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:14.300
It draws out the potential of your technique

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:18.100
and uses imagination to show 
you the course it'll take.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.400
But it isn't easy.

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:22.650
A ton of energy is expended

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:25.500
to turn what you imagine into reality.

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:28.730
So you're exhausted from that...

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:31.600
I'm a light eater,

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:34.780
so I can only perform at that level you 
saw once every two or three months.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:36.550
What should...

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:37.910
What should I do?!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.520
To learn that routine!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.180
Start by picturing it, Toriko.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.060
Just imagine!

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.760
Just... imagine...

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.560
Imagine a technique better than normal.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:53.730
And then bring it to life!

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.500
It'll all be just as you picture it!

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.810
Just as I...

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.770
...picture it...

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:04.910
Believe it!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.480
Have no doubts!

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:08.480
There's nothing to fear!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:09.810
There's nothing to worry about!

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.560
No matter who your opponent is,

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:14.090
you <i>will</i> win!

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:15.210
No...

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.950
You've already won!

00:16:17.130 --> 00:16:19.870
I've already won!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.990
The rhythm of an unshakable king!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.900
The demeanor of a king who rules over all!

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:27.790
<i>That</i> is the supreme routine!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:32.670
Ultimate Routine!

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.020
Have you finally begun, Toriko?

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.860
It works...

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:55.030
...Starjun!

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:04.470
I see, Toriko.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.310
The movement you do when 
you unleash a technique...

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.250
Certainly, it's brushing 
your hands together, right?

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:18.170
So that's what that sound was...

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.180
Right before your attack hit,

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:25.600
I could see in my head what you had in mind.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:30.060
Even without doing the movement,

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.770
you produced the sound

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:35.570
and even showed me an image 
of the potential damage.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.630
It's a very powerful image, Toriko.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:43.640
A very clear image of me being defeated...

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:47.080
You're already

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.180
on my plate.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.320
That's good.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.660
Your feelings have caught up to me.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.620
On a mental level, we're evenly matched now.

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.730
Finally...

00:17:59.110 --> 00:18:01.590
...I believe we can have a decent fight.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:04.520
That line too...

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:06.960
...is just as I imagined it!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:30.980
Fork Spiked Punch!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.200
Fire Shield!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.860
I see...

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:53.510
Like with Spiked Punch, he made a line 
of Forks to increase penetrating power.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.820
But I'm surprised that he can even 
use remote control with them.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:03.070
These Forks are as hard as iron!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.990
But you're generating enough 
heat to melt 'em in an instant?!

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:11.390
So the image of perforating me

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:14.800
has brought forth a new technique?

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:16.930
Can you get rid of

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.370
all of these?!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:28.650
They're attackin' you from every angle!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:33.750
I'm already picturin' it!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.330
What kind of image

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.200
did you see?

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.510
I suppose it's about time 
for me to attack too.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:19.200
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:24.820
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:20:24.820 --> 00:20:30.340
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:20:30.340 --> 00:20:35.640
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:41.400
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:47.160
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:53.240
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:58.460
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:20:58.460 --> 00:20:59.880
Mega Raba

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:02.640
Mega Raba

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.620
Mega Raba

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:13.520
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.010
Guess the Legend!

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:13.110
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.200
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.650
In this epoch-making segment,

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:21.820
you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:31.500
Really?! Level 7

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:29.120
Today's "Really?!" level is 7!

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.500
Someone once said...

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.590
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.440
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:40.140
Really?! Level 7

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.140
Someone once said...

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:43.090
Drinking this tea will make your skin smooth

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:45.430
and increase your cuteness

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:48.490
so much it'll look like 
you're wearing makeup...

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.290
Something something!

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:54.030
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:21:54.030 --> 00:21:55.400
Start!

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:57.580
Increase your cuteness?

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.840
Think of an adjective...

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:00.660
Cu-tea!

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:02.150
So close!

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:05.030
But that's not it. Another word...

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:09.050
Someone once said...

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:21.450
Pre-tea

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:11.830
Drinking this tea will make your skin smooth

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:16.990
and increase your cuteness so much it'll 
look like you're wearing makeup...

00:22:16.990 --> 00:22:20.180
Pre-tea!

00:22:21.930 --> 00:22:23.010
Pre-tea!

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:24.630
I want that too!

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:28.580
You're pretty enough without drinking that!

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:29.890
Really?!

00:22:30.670 --> 00:22:32.320
Thank you!

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:37.100
You're as pretty as a Garara Gator, Tina-san!

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:39.010
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:22:39.010 --> 00:22:40.810
That's no kind of compliment!

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:43.790
And now, let's get back on 
track with our next segment!
